# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BLOG NAVIGATION MENU  (www/menu-blog.jemdoc)
#
# The blog pages include THIS menu instead of www/menu.jemdoc, exactly as the lab
# pages include www/menu-lab.jemdoc. Clicking *Blog* on the main site lands you in the
# blog, with this sidebar, and "Home" takes you back out.
#
# Same rules as the main menu:
#   * a line WITHOUT brackets is a coloured section heading;
#   * a line with brackets is a link:  Visible text [target-file.html]
#
# TO ADD A POST: add one line under the Blog heading below, then see guide.md
# §9.12 for the page itself.
#
# Careful: jemdoc marks the current entry with a SUFFIX test, so one page name
# must never be the tail of another. See guide.md §6.4.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
